        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "When <color=#ffe14b>Geo</color> meets <color=#ffe14b>Hydro</color> , and certain other conditions are met, a special <color=#ffe14b>Lunar-Crystallize</color> reaction occurs, and three Moondrifts will form near the target."
