        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "Triggering the Lunar-Crystallize reaction three times will initiate Moondrift Harmony, which deals Geo DMG to nearby opponents.\nThis DMG can trigger CRIT Hits, and the DMG dealt is based on all characters who have applied elements during the reaction."
